        ],
        "name": "Carnage",
        "text": "this is unreal…\n\nthe SpaceXAI engineer who leads Grok Bot, Lauren Tan - shipped 2,500 PRs last month - and reviews them after they land, in the morning\n\nI took SpaceXAI's Grok Bot docs + her 1-hour livestream and turned them into a 3-page prompting blueprint: \n\nthe 10-field prompt structure, the 4-rung trust ladder, the two loops, and the guardrails that let agents ship while you sleep.\n\nsend this PDF to your Grok Bot, save it as a skill, and turn it into an always-on team that actually finishes work",
