        "id": "2099455308284219727",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Elon Musk",
        "text": "People keep misunderstanding this. I CONTRIBUTED to Bostrom’s Superintelligence book and he thanks me by name in the foreword. \n\nI was thinking about AI safety long before 2014.",
